mapping "W6783.1" source="W6783" target="217776008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source is a Swedish ICD-10 extension of W67/W68 (drowning/submersion in swimming pool) with
        appended place-of-occurrence and activity codes (e.g. bostad, idrott, förvärvsarbete). The
        clinical injury concept is SNOMED CT 217776008. Target SNOMED CT 4318639 = (concept_code 217776008),
        the verified Athena crosswalk target for both parent codes W67 (45756315) and W68 (45756316).
        The place/activity suffixes are ICD-10 supplementary dimensions with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        concept; the target fully contains the clinical injury. Broader (one level: source adds
        non-clinical context detail). High tier: verified crosswalk, well-understood breadth mismatch.
        """
}
